1662 0 obj
  << /ActualText (You are a Product Manager at IndusInd General Insurance\054 tasked with re\055imagining how customers discover\054 purchase\054 and manage general insurance\056\nWhile insurance is one of the most important financial products\054 the customer experience remains fragmented\056 Users often purchase policies through different channels\054 struggle to understand coverage\054 forget renewals\054 face confusing claim processes\054 and rarely engage with their insurance until something goes wrong\056\nAs a result\054 insurance is viewed as a one\055time transaction rather than an ongoing protection service\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1663 0 R
     /Pg 1592 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

