1666 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Indian general insurance industry is rapidly digitizing\054 yet customer experience continues to lag behind\056\nKey observations include\072\nCustomers often own multiple insurance policies across different providers with no unified management experience\056\nInsurance products remain difficult to understand due to technical jargon and low transparency\056\nClaims continue to be perceived as slow\054 stressful\054 and documentation\055heavy\056\nYoung\054 digital\055first customers expect proactive reminders\054 personalized recommendations\054 and self\055service experiences\056\nBanks already possess strong customer relationships\054 financial data\054 and trust\054 creating an opportunity to become a one\055stop protection platform instead of simply acting as insurance distributors\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 1667 0 R
     /Pg 1592 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

