1672 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Design a unified insurance platform that enables IndusInd Bank to\072\nIncrease insurance adoption among existing banking customers\056\nImprove policy renewal rates and customer retention\056\nSimplify policy management and claims\056\nDrive cross\055sell opportunities across multiple insurance categories\056\nCreate long\055term customer engagement through value\055added services\056\nDifferentiate itself from traditional insurers through superior digital experiences\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1673 0 R
     /Pg 1592 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
