1676 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Design a mobile\055first platform that goes beyond purchasing insurance\056\nYour solution should help customers throughout their insurance lifecycle\056\nConsider experiences such as\072\nDiscovering suitable insurance products based on customer profile and life stage\056\nComparing policies in a simple and transparent manner\056\nPurchasing and managing multiple policies from one place\056\nFiling\054 tracking and managing claims digitally\056\nPersonalized renewal reminders and proactive recommendations\056\nAI\055powered assistance for insurance education and customer support\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 1677 0 R
     /Pg 1592 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
